(7734226, 1274686, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow that bottom right one was very difficult to find, anyway great catch, and I love how you made the sky very dramatic. Congratulations on your honourable mention.</td>', 'Wow that bottom right one was very difficult to find, anyway great catch, and I love how you made the sky very dramatic. Congratulations on your honourable mention.', '2022-12-09 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734228, 1274686, 97225, '<td valign="top">Thanks for circling the raccoons. I only found four of them, but now that you show us there it is! This was my only 10 for this challenge, partly because of the raccoons, partly because of the old train, but also because of that phenomenal light. You can''t beat sunshine against a stormy sky, can you?</td>', 'Thanks for circling the raccoons. I only found four of them, but now that you show us there it is! This was my only 10 for this challenge, partly because of the raccoons, partly because of the old train, but also because of that phenomenal light. You can''t beat sunshine against a stormy sky, can you?', '2022-12-09 00:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734231, 1274694, 68504, '<td valign="top">yikes! and here you are on the front page <i>again</i>!</td>', 'yikes! and here you are on the front page again!', '2022-12-09 00:37:58.000000', NULL, 0),
