(7734235, 1274686, 75585, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jomari:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for circling the raccoons. I only found four of them, but now that you show us there it is! This was my only 10 for this challenge, partly because of the raccoons, partly because of the old train, but also because of that phenomenal light. You can''t beat sunshine against a stormy sky, can you? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You really had to look for the one covered; such a bummer, he is so cute hanging on by his little fingertips.  Yes, the light was phenomenal on that day, very stormy, it started snowing the next day.</td>', 'Originally posted by jomari: Thanks for circling the raccoons. I only found four of them, but now that you show us there it is! This was my only 10 for this challenge, partly because of the raccoons, partly because of the old train, but also because of that phenomenal light. You can''t beat sunshine against a stormy sky, can you?   You really had to look for the one covered; such a bummer, he is so cute hanging on by his little fingertips.  Yes, the light was phenomenal on that day, very stormy, it started snowing the next day.', '2022-12-09 00:51:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734236, 1274686, 75585, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow that bottom right one was very difficult to find, anyway great catch, and I love how you made the sky very dramatic. Congratulations on your honourable mention. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Much thanks, thank you for the in voting comment.  I thought for sure I would have more with people answering/participating in the hunt.  Oh well.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Wow that bottom right one was very difficult to find, anyway great catch, and I love how you made the sky very dramatic. Congratulations on your honourable mention.   Much thanks, thank you for the in voting comment.  I thought for sure I would have more with people answering/participating in the hunt.  Oh well.', '2022-12-09 00:53:03.000000', NULL, 0),
